			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
	&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;div&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Enterprise Lou-Tex NGL Pipeline L.P. (&amp;#x201C;Lou-Tex&amp;#x201D;) is a Texas limited partnership and a consolidated subsidiary of Enterprise Products Partners L.P. (&amp;#x201C;EPD&amp;#x201D;), a Delaware partnership, through the 99% interest held by Enterprise Products Operating LLC (&amp;#x201C;EPOLLC&amp;#x201D;), a Texas limited liability company and the 1% interest held by HSC Pipeline Partnership, LLC, a Texas limited liability company. EPOLLC is the operator of Lou-Tex.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Description of the Property&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Lou-Tex is a bi-directional natural gas liquids (&amp;#x201C;NGL&amp;#x201D;) pipeline that is approximately 200 miles in length.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;The pipeline extends from certain of EPD's Louisiana gas processing plants and underground storage facilities to EPD's Mont Belvieu, Texas NGL fractionation facility.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements conform to those required by FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Financial statements are prepared on &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;the accrual&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt; basis of accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Property, plant and equipment assets are recorded at original cost.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Lou-Tex's revenues are derived primarily from transportation of NGLs under tariffs regulated by the FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;The tariffs specify the amounts to be paid by shippers for service between receipt and delivery locations and the general terms and conditions of transportation services on the pipeline system.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Revenues are recorded upon delivery of products to customers.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Lou-Tex is a limited partnership that passes income tax liability through the partnership to the partners and does not recognize this liability on the partnership's financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;For purposes of calculating the income tax expense and liability for the annual cost of service (shown on page 700 of the annual report) Lou-Tex employs FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-weight:bold"&gt;Employees&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;br /&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Lou-Tex has no employees of its own.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;All operations, management, and administrative functions are performed by employees of Enterprise Products Company on behalf of EPOLLC as operator.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; -aw-import:spaces"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"&gt;Lou-Tex reimburses EPOLLC for management and administrative functions under the terms of an operating agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:12pt"&gt;&#xD;
				&lt;span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'; "&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&#xD;
			&lt;/p&gt;&#xD;
		&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;
	&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock id="HH11476EB422E065C84DE3B12A8533C405" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfEventsThatHaveAMaterialEffectToRespondentsTextBlock>
